   "description": "sum by (result) (rate(ws_connect_total[5m])) \u2014 reconnect health from the agent side. result \u2208 {ok, upgrade_fail, auth_fail, timeout}. A rising auth_fail means the bearer token is being rejected at upgrade; upgrade_fail/timeout point at a proxy mangling Upgrade or an unreachable endpoint (the agent falls back to HTTP, design \u00a73.1).",
