   "title": "Agent ws frame throughput sent/recv by op (#1848)",
   "description": "sum by (op) (rate(ws_frames_sent_total[5m])) and ws_frames_recv_total \u2014 agent-side frame throughput. sent op \u2208 {usage, events, ping}; recv op \u2208 {policy, ack, pong, unknown}. A pushed policy shows up as recv op=policy (the server-side push is #1849); usage/events sent are the outbound spool drain. recv op=unknown is the agent's forward-compat counter for an unrecognised server op.",
